    {
      "dom_id": "question-102802",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "Which of the following represents the solution to the system of linear equations given below?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}4x-2y=4 \\\\ 6=5x\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we reorganize the equations so that they are in the right order, to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}4x-2y=4 \\\\ 5x=6.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can represent this system of equations in the form $Ax=b:$\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 5 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 5 & 0\\end{aligned}].$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{4\\cdot 0-5\\cdot (-2)}[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ -5 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ -5 & 4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now find the solution to this system as:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ -5 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Correct",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-102802\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">6.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/934#4509\">Solving a 2x2 System of Equations Using an Inverse Matrix With Reorganization</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"102802\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Which of the following represents the solution to the system of linear equations given below?</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"70\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 5.868em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right;\"><mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7B TEX-S3\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtable justify=\"right\" style=\"min-width: 5.118em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-top: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1